cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "F1 Strategy Analytics at Scale"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end big-data pipeline for Formula 1 undercut strategy: a partitioned 2021-2025 data
  lake on HDFS, Spark RDD/DataFrame/SQL feature engineering, a calibrated MLlib model of undercut
  success evaluated on a sealed 2025 test season, Kafka and Spark Structured Streaming replay with
  a Redis serving layer, a FastAPI + Next.js dashboard, and a Monte Carlo what-if simulator.
  Course project of team Data Wranglers, DA231o, MTech, Indian Institute of Science (IISc).
authors:
